    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>This leather bracelet is strung with three small crystal beads made from a decommissioned mythallar. As a Magic action, you can pluck a bead from it to gain Advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks for 1 minute.</p><p>A plucked bead disappears at once. Once all three beads are gone, the bracelet loses its magic.</p>",
